<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2001187830"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1605552319"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Don't stop me lyrics"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="高瀬統也"/><amll:meta key="album" value="13月2日"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:06.832"><div begin="00:11.585" end="02:53.347"><p begin="00:11.585" end="00:14.270" itunes:key="L95305">言葉の文で 後悔の運命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一句话便造就追悔莫及的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba no a ya de ko u ka i no sa da me</span></p><p begin="00:14.360" end="00:17.225" itunes:key="L95306">折れた心が君との差だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这颗受挫的心令你我相距甚远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o re ta ko ko ro ga ki mi to no sa da ne</span></p><p begin="00:17.233" end="00:19.885" itunes:key="L95307">飛び出して アテもなく 泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳脱桎梏后却因漫无目的而无措哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi da shi te a te mo na ku na i te</span></p><p begin="00:19.982" end="00:22.660" itunes:key="L95308">風の速さで 全て忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能以风速让我忘却往昔种种</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze no ha ya sa de su be te wa su re ta i</span></p><p begin="00:22.664" end="00:25.782" itunes:key="L95309">君がいない Solo Highway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你在 我独自驰骋在高速公路上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga i na i solo highway</span></p><p begin="00:28.277" end="00:31.180" itunes:key="L95310">気づけば遠くまで来てる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回过神来发现自己竟走了如此之远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki du ke ba to o ku ma de ki te</span></p><p begin="00:33.612" end="00:37.823" itunes:key="L95311">ねぇ ツネって 目を覚まして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 捏我一下 让我从梦中醒来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne tsu ne 't te me wo sa ma shi te</span></p><p begin="00:39.196" end="00:43.986" itunes:key="L95312">溢れて 目を塞いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水夺眶不由得捂上双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re te me wo fu sa i de</span></p><p begin="00:44.867" end="00:48.173" itunes:key="L95313">Don't stop me lyrics 綺麗な花火だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span></p><p begin="00:47.690" end="00:51.678" itunes:key="L95314">Don't stop me lyrics 思い出して 泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki re i na ha na bi da ne</span></p><p begin="00:50.526" end="00:56.485" itunes:key="L95315">Don't stop me lyrics 君だって同じじゃない？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da shi te na i te</span></p><p begin="00:56.493" end="01:02.360" itunes:key="L95316">最低な夜 描いていく 最初で最後 カッコつかないね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在糟糕至极的夜晚描绘从前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i te i na yo ru e ga i te i ku</span></p><p begin="01:02.433" end="01:08.866" itunes:key="L95317">会いたくて また 呆れる Hold On<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对你思念无比 却又对此愕然无措 驻足原地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta ku te ma ta a ki re ru hold on</span></p><p begin="01:18.638" end="01:19.678" itunes:key="L95318">Where are you now?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旅途之中处处充斥着跌宕起伏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Where are you now?</span></p><p begin="01:19.684" end="01:22.507" itunes:key="L95319">旅路はどこまでもUP &amp; DOWN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旅途无论在何处都是跌宕起伏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta bi ji ha do ko ma de mo up&amp; down</span></p><p begin="01:22.515" end="01:25.332" itunes:key="L95320">弱さで壊され 終わったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切因软弱尽毁 唯有无疾而终</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo wa sa de ko wa sa re o wa 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:25.348" end="01:27.367" itunes:key="L95321">ゲリラ どこかの交差点<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍若一场游击战 在某处的叉路口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge ri ra do ko ka no ko u sa te n</span></p><p begin="01:27.519" end="01:30.437" itunes:key="L95322">右左？前だけ向けりゃいいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">往右还是往左？明明只能勇往直前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi gi hi da ri ？ ma e da ke mu ke rya i i no ni</span></p><p begin="01:30.439" end="01:33.158" itunes:key="L95323">君だけが消えた イエスタデイ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有你的身影消失在了昨天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi da ke ga ki e ta i e su ta de i</span></p><p begin="01:36.020" end="01:39.096" itunes:key="L95324">全てが遠くに見えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都已变得朦胧渐远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te ga to o ku ni mi e te</span></p><p begin="01:41.242" end="01:45.692" itunes:key="L95325">ねぇ ツネって 目を覚まして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 捏我一下 让我从梦中醒来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne tsu ne 't te me wo sa ma shi te</span></p><p begin="01:47.037" end="01:51.630" itunes:key="L95326">溢れて 目を塞いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水夺眶不由得捂上双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re te me wo fu sa i de</span></p><p begin="01:52.600" end="01:56.187" itunes:key="L95327">Don't stop me lyrics 綺麗な花火だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span></p><p begin="01:55.413" end="01:59.413" itunes:key="L95328">Don't stop me lyrics 思い出して 泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烟花太过美轮美奂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki re i na ha na bi da ne</span></p><p begin="01:58.373" end="02:04.333" itunes:key="L95329">Don't stop me lyrics 君だって同じじゃない？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da shi te na i te</span></p><p begin="02:04.287" end="02:10.131" itunes:key="L95330">最低な夜 描いていく 最初で最後 カッコつかないね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在糟糕至极的夜晚描绘从前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i te i na yo ru e ga i te i ku</span></p><p begin="02:10.182" end="02:16.685" itunes:key="L95331">会いたくて また 呆れる Hold On<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对你思念无比 却又对此愕然无措 驻足原地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta ku te ma ta a ki re ru hold on</span></p><p begin="02:15.231" end="02:19.611" itunes:key="L95332">ねぇ ツネって 目を覚まして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 捏我一下 让我从梦中醒来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne tsu ne 't te me wo sa ma shi te</span></p><p begin="02:20.818" end="02:25.691" itunes:key="L95333">溢れた 目も塞いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水夺眶不由得捂上双眼 喃喃着对不起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re ta me mo fu sa i de 「 go me n ne 」 to</span></p><p begin="02:28.209" end="02:32.204" itunes:key="L98301">「ごめんね」と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说声“抱歉”</span></p><p begin="02:29.315" end="02:35.604" itunes:key="L95334">Don't stop me lyrics 綺麗な花火だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span></p><p begin="02:32.205" end="02:35.669" itunes:key="L6092">Don't stop me lyrics 思い出して泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki re i na ha na bi da ne</span></p><p begin="02:35.053" end="02:40.869" itunes:key="L95336">Don't stop me lyrics 君だって同じじゃない？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">don't stop me lyrics</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da shi te na i te</span></p><p begin="02:40.879" end="02:46.751" itunes:key="L95337">最低な夜 描いていく 最初で最後 カッコつかないね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在糟糕至极的夜晚描绘从前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i te i na yo ru e ga i te i ku</span></p><p begin="02:46.908" end="02:53.347" itunes:key="L95338">会いたくて また 呆れる Hold On<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对你思念无比 却又对此愕然无措 驻足原地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta ku te ma ta a ki re ru hold on</span></p></div></body></tt>